# This folder is a template payload: the Bootstrapper copies these files verbatim out of
# the working tree into every scaffolded application, and they are then built and run
# inside Linux containers. They must keep LF endings regardless of the repository-wide
# `* text=auto eol=crlf` policy in the root .gitattributes — a stray CR breaks `#!`
# shebangs, the husky pre-commit hook, and the shell scripts the CI workflows run.
* text=auto eol=lf
